            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka iwe tikwo origirira MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe; ahakuba bo bakaba bakorera baaruhanga baabo buri kintu kyona ekirikunugwa eki MUKAMA ayanga; nangwa na batabani baabo na bahara baabo nabo babookyeza baaruhanga baabo omu muriro. ",
          "type": "text",
